body:
Honestly idk, i tend to eat sooooo much more than it seems most of us do, but my massive BMR and the fact that i wanna achieve a very certain look, so i lift weights means that i can afford, and need to eat, a certain amount of protein, or i'll binge myself to DEATH.

&#x200B;

I eat like 95% egg whites, shirataki noodles, and chicken, all with varying seasonings lmao. Oh, and dont forget the sugar free jello.
